		{
			description: [
				"This pack is intended to be played on &bPeaceful&r."
				""
				"You start off in &2The Overworld&r, a resource-rich wilderness dotted by clusters of urban buildings like the one you spawned in."
				""
				"If you wish to have a blank palette for building your base, place the &6Void World Cake&r down on the ground and eat a slice to be sent to the &7Void World&r. "
				""
				"Simply place down and eat any dimensional cake for access to that dimension."
				""
				"If you're playing with friends, don't forget to invite them to an &eFTB Teams party&r. "
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Beginner tips on &2Gregtech&r and &2Monifactory&r features will be higlighted in &2dark green&r."
				""
				"More advanced tips about &9Monifactory&r and other mod quirks will be higlighted in &9Blue&r."
				""
				"Notes about things in &5Beta&r will be higlighted in &5Dark Purple&r."
				""
