		{
			dependencies: ["133B31B88DC65834"]
			description: [
				"&b&lEMI&r is the list of all items that you see every time you open your inventory. It's the better(tm) recipe book that shows you all available items and recipes in the modpack. Note that &b&lEMI&r is based on &b&lJEI&r, and people tend to use the names interchangeably."
				""
				"To see it in action, pull up a quest that requires an item of some sort and just click the item!"
				""
				"[\"\",{\"text\":\"If you want to know how to craft an item, just hover your mouse over it and press \"},{\"color\":\"gold\",\"underlined\":true,\"bold\":1,\"text\":\"R\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":{\"text\":\"\\\"Show Recipe\\\" in keybind option\"}}},{\"text\":\". EMI will list all available recipes.\"}]"
				""
				"[\"\",{\"text\":\"If you instead want to know what recipes use an item, hover over it and press \"},{\"color\":\"gold\",\"underlined\":true,\"bold\":1,\"text\":\"U\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":{\"text\":\"\\\"Show Uses\\\" in keybind option\"}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
				""
				"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hover over an item and press \"},{\"color\":\"gold\",\"underlined\":true,\"bold\":1,\"text\":\"A\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":{\"text\":\"\\\"Add/Remove Bookmark\\\" in keybind option\"}}},{\"text\":\" to bookmark it. To remove a bookmarked item from the list, press \"},{\"color\":\"gold\",\"underlined\":true,\"bold\":1,\"text\":\"A\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":{\"text\":\"\\\"Add/Remove Bookmark\\\" in keybind option\"}}},{\"text\":\" on the bookmark.\"}]"
			]
			disable_toast: true
			icon: "ftbquests:book"
			id: "565CEB96B808827A"
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.75d
			subtitle: "&eUSE EMI!!!&r"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3D960F11E60576E5"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "&9&lUse EMI! Use EMI! USE. EMI."
			x: 0.0d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5BBF1938168F115D"]
			description: [
				"&c&rOres in &9Monifactory&f exist in large clusters, or '&eveins&f'. These veins are scattered around the world, and are relatively common. &2The upgraded HV Electric Prospector's Scanner you were given will tell you the types of ores you can find within a 7x7 chunk area! &9You can also click on an ore vein to mark it on your map!"
				"&r"
				"While the Prospector requires energy to work, you are unlikely to deplete its battery. That said, the quest book will later guide you towards making &2an HV Battery&r to charge &aHV tools &rin your inventory."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"In order to proceed, you'll need to locate a source of &6Iron&f. You have a few options. &6Magnetite&f veins are higher up and contain large amounts of iron, as well as some &6Vanadium&f and &6Gold&f. Another good source of iron is &6Goethite&f veins, which contain several types of iron. Finally, &6Pyrite&f can be found paired with &6Copper&f in several types of veins."
				""
				"&6Wrought Iron&f is obtained simply by &esmelting Iron a second time&f. It has more durability than Iron, so it is better for making tools, but &cdo not convert your entire Iron supply over to Wrought Iron&f. The two materials are not interchangeable and you'll need Iron or Wrought Iron as demanded by various recipes."
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			icon: "gtceu:wrought_iron_ingot"
			id: "7F41F6FD59E77410"
			rewards: [{
				id: "4D1286129567406B"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "trofers:large_pillar"
					tag: {
						BlockEntityTag: {
							Trophy: "monifactory:wrought_iron"
						}
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.75d
			subtitle: "ULV Beginnings"
			tasks: [
				{
					count: 12L
					id: "123E769D7098F9E3"
					item: { Count: 12, id: "minecraft:iron_ingot" }
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					count: 12L
					id: "73557F33D4562FE6"
