		{
			dependencies: ["7F41F6FD59E77410"]
			description: [
				"&bSophisticated Storage&r and &bSophisticated Backpacks&r are great options for storing items, both at your base and on the go, as well as offering a variety of both helpful and fun upgrades."
				""
				"&bSophisticated Storage&r in particular is great for cheap storage, able to store 3 barrels worth of items at its lowest tier, costing only a bit of steel and invar to craft, and can be upgraded with barrel upgrades to hold even more items and upgrades."
