		{
			dependencies: ["42DB312E05F7A2FE"]
			description: [
				"The &aCrescent Hammer&r is for use on machines from &bThermal Expansion&f, but can be used for basic wrench interactions with blocks from almost every mod. &9It can also now adjust Gregtech pipes."
				""
				"The &aYeta Wrench&r is used with machines from &bEnder IO&f, and has several special display modes (&6sneak-mouse wheel&f to switch between them)."
				""
				"The &aGregTech Wrench&r is used to rotate GregTech machines and redefine their output sides. &2It also has some of the capabilities of the other Wrenches.&r"
				""
				"You can see which mod a machine is from with the &9blue text&f at the bottom of its tooltip."
			]
