		{
			dependencies: ["42DB312E05F7A2FE"]
			description: [
				"&6Redstone&f: Exclusively found in massive veins paired with &6Cinnabar&f and &6Ruby&f, in the Deepslate layer."
				""
				"&6Copper&f: Two primary sources. &6Azurite&f veins are higher up, while &6Chalcopyrite&f veins are lower, paired with some small amounts of &6Iron&f. You'll also find &6Malachite&f inside of Iron veins; this is another type of copper ore."
				""
				"&6Tin&f: Found essentially at ground level. &6Cassiterite&f is another type of tin ore, and they're always found together. If you cannot find a vein of tin, there are small amounts of tin inside veins of &6Aluminium&f and &6Rock Salt&f, which might be enough to hold you over until you find a proper tin vein."
				""
				"&6Coal&f: Found in relatively shallow depths."
				""
				"&6Gold&f: Found inside of &6Magnetite&f veins, relatively close to the surface."
			]
