		{
			dependencies: ["77A783FB35A327DC"]
			description: [
				"While there are no types of veins that are extremely rare, you're likely to struggle with finding at least one of the less common vein types. This isn't really avoidable."
				""
				""
				"[\"\",{\"text\":\"You will accumulate a lot of \"},{\"color\":\"gold\",\"text\":\"Monicoins\"},{\"text\":\" Search for various ores (generally the first one listed in \"},{\"color\":\"aqua\",\"text\":\"EMI\"},{\"text\":\") to find the coin recipes for them. Alternatively, hover your cursor over a coin and press \"},{\"color\":\"gold\",\"underlined\":true,\"bold\":1,\"text\":\"U\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":{\"text\":\"\\\"Show Uses\\\" in keybind option\"}}},{\"text\":\" to see what you can buy with it.\"}]"
			]
			icon: "kubejs:moni_dollar"
			id: "6CD4982E0F20E1B9"
			rewards: [{
				id: "41BF438ADAF16AC1"
				item: {
					Count: 1
