			y: 13.0d
		}
		{
			can_repeat: true
			dependencies: ["77A783FB35A327DC"]
			description: [
				"Prospectors show a display of the ores available in the chunks around you."
				""
				"Mousing over a chunk shows the amount of each type of ore in that chunk, and the list to the right allows you to select specific ores within range."
				""
				"If you &osomehow&r run out of charge on your prospector, simply submit it back in and we'll give you a fresh one!"
