		{
			dependencies: ["5F0354B89C3A3E31"]
			description: [
				"This pack has &aSnad&r, which is simply a sand-like block that instantly grows sugar cane/cactus on top of it when it receives either a block update or a redstone update."
				""
				"The sugar cane it produces can be used as a fuel for your dynamos, and later you can even brew it for &9Biomass&r."
				""
				"This quest calls for a &aRedstone Clock&r because it grows Snad even on the fastest setting - vanilla Observer clocks pulse too quickly."
				""
				"To collect the sugar cane, you can use a piston and an observer."
				""
				"For now, a &3Vacuum Chest&r should help keep the floor clean, and causes less lag than Hoppers. A &6Void Upgrade&r in a &6Storage Drawer&r will automatically delete any items that overflow the drawer's capacity, so it's a good way to ensure you don't crash your server from accumulating a massive sugar cane pile."
				""
				""
				"[\"\",{\"text\":\"If the noises are annoying to you, take a look at \"},{\"underlined\":true,\"text\":\"this\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5B52FFEBF5D65C20\"}},{\"text\":\" quest to see how to mute them.\"}]"
			]
			icon: "snad:snad"
