		{
			dependencies: ["77A783FB35A327DC"]
			description: [
				"This questbook is made to help you throughout your entire playthrough. &eIt is &lHIGHLY&r&e advised to read it!&r"
				""
				"Most questbook chapters use dependencies (the lines with arrows) to signify which quests to do in what order. When a quest is gray-ed out and has a locked icon, it means that one or more of its dependency quests are not completed. \n\nThe dependencies of a quest can be seen by clicking on the left arrow to the left of the Tasks. You can also see what quests depend on this quest using the right arrow to the right of the Rewards."
				""
				"If you complete the tasks for a quest before you've completed its dependencies, the quest will display a gray check mark, and will be instantly completed when unlocked. These pre-completed quests won't count as completed for other quests that depend on it while locked."
				""
				"When looking for a quest, try using Control/Command + F to search for a quest based on its name or tasks."
			]
			id: "133B31B88DC65834"
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.75d
			tasks: [{
				id: "1C4117728CBBA036"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Quests Are Here to Help"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
