				"The &6Steam Foundry&r functions as 8 &7LV &3Alloy Smelters&r in parallel! It requires an input of &9Steam&r through a &eSteam Hatch&r, but it uses very little Steam, perfect for bulk crafting alloys or mold recipes. It takes 240mb of &9Steam&r per tick to run."
