			]
			dependency_requirement: "all_started"
			description: [
				"A \"&esubstrate&f\" is the \"board\" part of a circuit board — the backing that the circuit components and wires are laid into. A good substrate needs to not conduct electricity, for obvious reasons. &6Wood&r coated in &6Sticky Resin&r is a primitive but effective material to use as your first substrate."
				""
				"You'll also need to make &6Vacuum Tubes&f, as well as some primitive &6Resistors&r. &6Paper&r will work as a material for these, for now."
			]
			disable_toast: true
			icon: "gtceu:resistor"
