		{
			dependencies: ["7457A13C74667E40"]
			description: ["The &6Forge Hammer&r, despite being inefficient at making plates, can be used to break Cobblestone into Gravel and Gravel into Sand. It's also used to combine 2 Rods into 1 Long Rod."]
